     "body": "<p>As Eddie pointed out in \n    <span class=\"jira-issue-macro resolved\" data-jira-key=\"FCREPO-660\" >\n                <a href=\"https://fedora-repository.atlassian.net/browse/FCREPO-660\" class=\"jira-issue-macro-key issue-link\"  title=\"Regression: setting FEDORA_HOME via context-param fails\" >\n            <img class=\"icon\" src=\"https://fedora-repository.atlassian.net/rest/api/2/universal_avatar/view/type/issuetype/avatar/10303?size=medium\" />\n            FCREPO-660\n        </a>\n                                                    <span class=\"aui-lozenge aui-lozenge-subtle aui-lozenge-success jira-macro-single-issue-export-pdf\">Closed</span>\n            </span>\n (a dupe of this bug), for trunk, this was serendipitously addressed by r8516 (done for FCREPO-630: move to slf4j), with the addition of org.fcrepo.server.utilities.LogSetupContextListener which now houses the code in ServletController that was responsible for setting servlet.fedora.home.</p>\n",
